0.094 0.106 0.157 rg
45.354330708661422 756.8506299212598378 Td
(Live Track is a real-time bus tracking platform for schools. Every driver's phone becomes a live GPS device --) Tj
T* (no separate hardware, no SIM per vehicle, no installer visit. The driver opens the app, taps Start, and their) Tj
T* (bus streams live to the school's admin dashboard and to every parent linked to a child on that bus.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
12.0749999999999993 TL
0.094 0.106 0.157 rg
45.354330708661422 705.1750393700787072 Td
(The platform was built first for a Kigali school in closed pilot, but every feature -- driver app, admin) Tj
T* (dashboard, parent map -- adapts to any operator that needs live visibility over people they trust with vehicles.) Tj
T* (Delivery, ride-share, field teams: same system, same phones.) Tj
ET
